{"author":{"id":"1949ffc23f11a8cb4f8c42a45c9ad241b49570df9a18687489e9ea78d87c54a3"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1778517019,"nonce":"mx/lV9hQHTMlv5sIwalRvxqOPdA=","title":"Fix entry-point discovery + dead CLI scripts post feedbax_experiments merge","message":"## Symptoms\n\nAfter the `feedbax_experiments` package was merged into `feedbax`, the plugin discovery + CLI surface broke in three ways:\n\n1. **Entry-point group name mismatch.** rlrmp registers `[project.entry-points.\"feedbax.plugins\"]`, but `feedbax.plugins.discovery.discover_experiment_packages` defaults to group `\"feedbax_experiments.packages\"`. Net effect: `EXPERIMENT_REGISTRY` is empty at import; only a `logger.warning` indicates anything is wrong. All `feedbax-train` / `feedbax-analysis` invocations that depend on `EXPERIMENT_REGISTRY` silently fail to find any experiments.\n2. **Live `import feedbax_experiments` in two scripts.** `feedbax/bin/train.py:25` and `feedbax/analysis/execution.py:30` import the now-deleted `feedbax_experiments` package. Both pass it to `log_version_info(git_modules=(feedbax, feedbax_experiments))` so loading either path raises `ModuleNotFoundError` before anything useful runs.\n3. **`feedbax/bin/run.py` docstring is stale** — it advertises forwarding to `feedbax_experiments.scripts.train:main()` / `feedbax_experiments.scripts.run_analysis:main()`. The actual `_dispatch` code already imports `feedbax.bin.\u003ccmd\u003e` correctly, so only the docstring is wrong.\n\n## Fix plan\n\n- **Option A (canonical):** Change `discover_experiment_packages` default group to `\"feedbax.plugins\"` (matches current module path and rlrmps registration). feedbax-side only; no rlrmp changes needed.\n- Drop the `import feedbax_experiments` lines and the `feedbax_experiments` entry in `git_modules=(...)` tuples.\n- Fix the `run.py` docstring.\n- Sweep residual `feedbax_experiments` strings: most are comments / historical markers — fix in passing or leave as documentation.\n\n`feedbax_merge_spec.md` stays as historical record of the merge.","files":null}]}